<title>PORTUGAL: Tranquilidade sets 50 esc div '96.</title>
<headline>Tranquilidade sets 50 esc div '96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Portuguese insurer Companhia de Seguros Tranquilidade said it would propose to the general assembly a gross dividend of 50 escudos per share for 1996, up from 40 escudos in 1995.</p>
<p>Tranquilidade said it had set aside 950 million escudos for dividends.</p>
<p>The insurer posted a net consolidated profit of 2.545 billion escudos in 1996, compared with 2.045 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
